DS Bot Mobile Web

Mobile layout and host-adapter integration for the existing DS Bot / DSH client.

This project includes an unmodified pinned Git submodule of:
https://github.com/Fei2411/DeepSeek-Bot
Commit: e522ca474f38a7c7d4d1e8d1c08f1b542fa2667f
License: Apache License 2.0 (see the upstream LICENSE and plugin NOTICE).

The mobile client bundles upstream BotAvatar, BotMark, RoomAvatar, botState,
character graphics and their imported modules. The build changes only the SVG
mask namespace from bt-mark- to dsm-mark- to avoid same-document collisions.
Upstream sources are not patched; DSH and DS Bot remain independent dependencies.

Mobile stylesheet selector compilation adapts the installCompiledStyles approach
documented in ds-bot/src/client/styles.js, with an independent owned style element
and stylesheet-only discovery/lifecycle handling.

The mobile client also bundles qrcode 1.5.4 and dijkstrajs for local QR encoding.
Their MIT copyright and license texts are included in
mobile-web-prototype/plugin/NOTICE and travel with the installable package.
